  "created": "2020-06-08T23:54:38.306Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Add an OnAfterIK event that runs updates after FinalIK IK updates that take place in LateUpdate(). This is primarily for use for things like VRCPlayerApi.GetBonePosition/GetBoneRotation which will get the previous frame's bone data if run in Update and will get the idle pose position/rotation if run in LateUpdate. \nThis currently can be worked around using OnWillRenderObject(), but it needs a mesh attached to the game object doing the updating and will update multiple times per frame. So it'd be nice to have a dedicated event for it.",
